                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It's the only non-profit option here in Middle TN!  If we lose @AliveHospice for-profit pirates who brag that they only spend 54 cents of every Medicare dollar on patients will be at our bedside.\n\nAnother great piece by @scavendish \n\n3/\n\nhttps://t.co/5GmNfG6uFm",
