                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Running hospice is hard, but needed.  Running a foundation is easy by comparison. Caring for patients v writing checks. @AliveHospice is worth $50-100 million today. Current leadership is selling out, betraying us, for 30 pieces of silver.\n\n10/",
